WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,410
But Chenghan is a boy

2
00:00:01,410 --> 00:00:02,450
I still have a boyfriend

3
00:00:02,450 --> 00:00:05,120
Chenghan lives with other boys

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:07,440
I bought the drawings of the smart toilet

5
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:09,640
Guess how many resources were spent?

6
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:11,500
Oh, how many resources

7
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,060
It only cost two loaves

8
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:14,420
Two bottles of mineral water

9
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:17,100
And a unit of wood is good

10
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:19,020
From now on we will do shopping at home

11
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:20,900
I'll leave it to you

12
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:22,140
Then I will continue shopping

13
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:24,260
See if we can gather the resources to build a toilet

14
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:26,930
toilet drawings

15
00:00:26,930 --> 00:00:28,330
I'm still getting paid to survive

16
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:30,290
They are actually planning to build a bathroom

17
00:00:30,330 --> 00:00:33,550
How come there are so many supplies?

18
00:00:33,550 --> 00:00:34,870
Classmate Wang Ziyan

19
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:36,310
What do you think about it?

20
00:00:36,310 --> 00:00:38,470
If you have any concerns, just tell me

21
00:00:38,470 --> 00:00:39,870
i have a boyfriend

22
00:00:39,870 --> 00:00:41,710
So I can’t cooperate with you

23
00:00:41,710 --> 00:00:43,150
We are just cooperating

24
00:00:43,150 --> 00:00:45,430
It’s not like you’re doing anything to feel sorry for your boyfriend.

25
00:00:45,430 --> 00:00:46,990
Are you thinking too much?

26
00:00:46,990 --> 00:00:48,310
I didn't mean that

27
00:00:48,310 --> 00:00:49,910
Mainly because this room is too small

28
00:00:49,910 --> 00:00:51,190
Men and women rest together

29
00:00:51,190 --> 00:00:52,150
will be very inconvenient
